        "E-004"
      ],
      "observedResult": "4 synthetic native sessions, 32 semantic/hash tamper rejections; 602 tests, 599 passes, exactly 3 preexisting Windows symlink skips, one final core regression",
      "rationale": "Verified evidence for the current target supports this criterion."
    },
    {
      "criterionId": "AC-003",
      "statement": "[AC-003] 원본 core와 기존 evidence를 보존하고 두 파일만 바뀌는 실험 복사본·source·bundle·ZIP·작업 범위를 검증한다.",
      "status": "satisfied",
      "evidenceRefs": [
        "E-005",
        "E-006"
      ],
      "observedResult": "1440 bundle files, exact variant/source and ZIP bytes, raw metrics independently recomputed; pre-research failure retained; PASS; excluded/unplanned/preexisting-overlap/ownership-unknown all zero",
      "rationale": "Verified evidence for the current target supports this criterion."
    },
    {
      "criterionId": "AC-004",
      "statement": "[AC-004] 결과 방향에 관계없이 해석과 다음 학습·재사용 비교의 조건 및 미해결 가설을 기록한다.",
      "status": "satisfied",
      "evidenceRefs": [
        "E-007",
        "E-008"
      ],
      "observedResult": "Observed native adoption change, unaffected control, alternatives, bounded claims and first preparation failure described; Formation before/after and held-out reuse paired design distinguished from existing EXP25; no new experiment claimed",
